license: Apache-2.0
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-10-08
abstract: >-
  Team Grenuke's solution to the Amazon ML Challenge 2026 business entity resolution task (3rd place at the Grand
  Finale). For every Source-1 business record it finds all Source-2/3 records that describe the same business, from
  names and addresses only, across the US, India and an unseen country (France). The pipeline combines token
  blocking, gradient-boosted pair scoring, multilingual cross-encoders on the uncertain band, guarded self-training
  for the unseen country, an expected-F0.5 set decision and generator-aware French rules.
keywords:
  - entity resolution
  - record linkage
  - blocking
  - cross-encoder
  - self-training
  - domain adaptation
  - F-beta
